This is something everyone can do. Pick one of the texts on=20
www.lojban.org/tiki/Texts+In+Lojban and record it. It's not difficult,=20
it does not take long. Yet, it helps everyone a lot.

Listening is the most fundamental part of language learning; How are we=20
supposed to get fluent speakers without the most essential ingredient =97=
=20
extensive exposure to audio?

Please help out.

