We hang out on mumble now and then. It would be nice to have these voice=20
chats more often, but of course it's hard to arrange fixed dates. A good=20
strategy would be for more people to simply lurk on mumble to show=20
_presence_. It has to become a given that there are always people=20
hanging out on mumble, just like there are always people in #lojban.

